                    <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Tsubaki</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-600 text-[10px] font-semibold text-white px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-sans uppercase">
                      BOT
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono">Today at 3:14 PM</span>
